@inherits ElementComponentBase
@* 列筛选面板：对齐 EP filter-panel.vue 的两态（勾选组 / 单选列表），另有本库扩展的条件式面板。
   不由使用者摆放，ElTable 点漏斗时才渲染一个，坐标由表格按触发器的视口矩形钉成 position:fixed ——
   absolute 会被 .cell / .el-table__header-wrapper 的 overflow:hidden 整条裁掉（「点不开」的真因）。 *@
<div class="el-table-filter @(Header?.AdvancedFilter == true ? "el-table-filter--advanced" : null)" style="@PanelStyle"
     @onclick:stopPropagation>
    @if (Header?.AdvancedFilter == true)
    {
        <div class="el-table-filter__content">
            @for (var slot = 0; slot < 2; slot++)
            {
                var index = slot;
                var condition = Slots[index];
                @* 关系下拉只挂在第二条上：第一条没有左操作数，它的 Relation 位不生效 *@
                if (index > 0)
                {
                    <div class="el-table-filter__relation">
                        <ElSelect TValue="string" Value="@RelationValue(condition)" Label="@RelationText(condition)"
                                  ValueChanged="@(v => RelationChanged(index, v))"
                                  Clearable="false" Size="InputSize.Small">
                            <ElOption TValue="string" Value="@("and")" Text="@RelationAndLabel" />
                            <ElOption TValue="string" Value="@("or")" Text="@RelationOrLabel" />
                        </ElSelect>
                    </div>
                }
                <div class="el-table-filter__rule">
                    <div class="el-table-filter__rule-op">
                        <ElSelect TValue="string" Value="@OperatorValue(condition)" Label="@LabelOf(condition.Operator)"
                                  ValueChanged="@(v => OperatorChanged(index, v))"
                                  Clearable="false" Size="InputSize.Small">
                            @foreach (var op in Operators)
                            {
                                <ElOption TValue="string" Value="@OperatorKey(op)" Text="@LabelOf(op)" />
                            }
                        </ElSelect>
                    </div>
                    @* 这里必须写 @if：@for 体里出现过标记之后 Razor 已切到标记上下文，
                       裸 if 会被当成正文——实测整句 "if (NeedsValue(condition)) {" 直接印进 DOM，
                       右值框被这段匿名文字挤到 11px 宽（面板 320px）。 *@
                    @if (NeedsValue(condition))
                    {
                        <div class="el-table-filter__rule-val">
                            <ElInput TValue="string" Value="@condition.Value"
                                     ValueChanged="@(v => ConditionValueChanged(index, v))"
                                     Size="InputSize.Small" />
                        </div>
                    }
                </div>
            }
        </div>
        <div class="el-table-filter__bottom">
            <button type="button" @onclick="ApplyAdvancedAsync">@ApplyLabel</button>
            <button type="button" @onclick="ClearAdvancedAsync">@AdvancedClearLabel</button>
        </div>
    }
    else if (Header?.FilterMultiple != false)
    {
        @* EP 口径：filter-multiple 默认 true —— 勾选组 +「筛选 / 重置」，点「筛选」才把草稿落到列上 *@
        <div class="el-table-filter__multiple">
            <div class="el-table-filter__content">
                <div class="el-table-filter__checkbox-group">
                    @foreach (var filter in Header?.Filters ?? new List<TableFilterOption>())
                    {
                        var option = filter;
                        <ElCheckbox TValue="Boolean" Label="@option.Text"
                                    Status="@(Draft.Contains(option.Value) ? Status.Checked : Status.UnChecked)"
                                    StatusChanged="@(s => ToggleOption(option, s))" />
                    }
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="el-table-filter__bottom">
                <button type="button" class="@(Draft.Count == 0 ? "is-disabled" : null)" disabled="@(Draft.Count == 0)"
                        @onclick="ConfirmAsync">@ConfirmLabel</button>
                <button type="button" @onclick="ResetDraftAsync">@ResetLabel</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    }
    else
    {
        @* EP 口径：filter-multiple=false —— 单选列表，首项「清除」，点一项即生效并收起（EP handleSelect 里 hidden()） *@
        <ul class="el-table-filter__list" role="radiogroup">
            <li class="el-table-filter__list-item @(Draft.Count == 0 ? "is-active" : null)" role="radio"
                aria-checked="@(Draft.Count == 0)" @onclick="ClearSingleAsync">@ClearLabel</li>
            @foreach (var filter in Header?.Filters ?? new List<TableFilterOption>())
            {
                var option = filter;
                <li class="el-table-filter__list-item @(IsSingleActive(option) ? "is-active" : null)" role="radio"
                    aria-checked="@IsSingleActive(option)" @onclick="@(e => SelectSingleAsync(option))">@option.Text</li>
            }
        </ul>
    }
</div>
